WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.000
What do you mean?

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Like any immigrants or...

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.000
That's what I said, immigrants overall.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Illegal immigrants.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Undocumented immigrants also contribute greatly to the U.S.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.000
I say undocumented, I don't think people are illegal.

